@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;design] gallery-keeps-card-order
The library mosaic MUST preserve the server's card order and every card ID when it
regroups cards into variable-width brick rows. Images fill their bricks; text cards
retain a readable preview. Tap and hold MUST target the same card at every density.
Source: Tavi, 22 October 2026, Google Photos layout request in the Codex conversation.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;motion] gallery-pinches-change-tile-size
A two-finger pinch on the mosaic MUST change tile size and regroup the cards. The
gesture MUST NOT open a card, open its action sheet, or trigger pull to refresh.
Reflow MUST keep a visible card at the gesture's position in view instead of returning
to the top. Equivalent larger/smaller actions MUST be available to accessibility.
Source: Tavi, 22 October 2026, explicit pinch-to-enlarge/reduce requirement.

@cc [owner:OctavianTocan,label:product;design] gallery-highlights-stay-above-the-bricks
Top of Mind MUST remain above the main mosaic, in pin order, as a horizontal rail of
large highlight cards. Profile and highlights MUST NOT scale with a mosaic pinch.
Source: Tavi, 22 October 2026, Google Photos layout request in the Codex conversation.
